atherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes at most 3 attempts, with exponential backoff between them.\n\n- **Settings:** two new constructor arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. The waits are 0.5s and then 1s, so the worst case adds 1.5s.\n- **Only 503 is retried.** Any other HTTP error is raised right away. If all 3 attempts return 503, the last error is raised to the caller.\n- **Not retried:** connection failures and timeouts (`URLError`), because the request only asked for 503.\n\n**Tested** against a real local HTTP server:\n\n| Server responses | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, 200 | returns the JSON | 3 |\n| 503 every time | raises HTTPError 503 | 3 (stops there) |\n| 500 | raises HTTPError 500 | 1 |\n| 200 | returns the JSON | 1 |\n\nI didn't add a test file to the repo; these checks were run ad hoc.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 69827, "requests_cache_write": 143662, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7670714, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1737, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial15", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 88, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:49:32.382605+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.926, "t_checker_s": 2.428, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1751, "tokens_cache_read": 69827, "tokens_cache_write": 143662, "tokens_fresh": 1751,